{"quest_id": 6122, "name": "都市防衛戦", "description": "更に多くの巨人族を引き連れ、\n太古の巨人ギガースが再び姿を現す。\n巨人の侵攻を阻止せよ！\n極級（★１獲得の目安：平均Lv25）", "event": "巨人殺しの剣", "event_category": "History", "mission_id": 920090, "map_no": 3974, "level": 100, "multiplier": 1.0, "charisma": 65, "capacity": 8, "enemies": [{"enemy_id": 1, "source": "local", "count": 7, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "hp": 9000, "attack": 350, "base_hp": 9000, "base_attack": 350, "damage_type": "magical", "armor_defense": 200, "attack_range": 90, "attack_speed": 60, "attack_wait": 30, "attack_interval": 133, "move_speed": 400.0, "gain_cost": 2, "dot_rate": 1.7999999523162842, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2100592, "race_id": 10, "special_effect_id": 232, "missile_id": 44, "missile": {"speed": 8.0}, "master_id": 270, "global_id": 269, "ranged": true}, {"enemy_id": 2, "source": "local", "count": 2, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "hp": 20000, "attack": 2000, "base_hp": 20000, "base_attack": 2000, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 300, "attack_speed": 120, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 241, "move_speed": 400.0, "gain_cost": 2, "dot_rate": 1.899999976158142, "assassin_resist": 100, "transform_resist": 100, "pattern_id": 2100176, "race_id": 10, "master_id": 321, "global_id": 320}, {"enemy_id": 3, "source": "local", "count": 2, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "hp": 120000, "attack": 3500, "base_hp": 120000, "base_attack": 3500, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 10, "attack_speed": 150, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 291, "move_speed": 400.0, "gain_cost": 3, "dot_rate": 1.600000023841858, "assassin_resist": 100, "transform_resist": 100, "pattern_id": 2110176, "race_id": 10, "master_id": 30267, "global_id": 3886}, {"enemy_id": 4, "source": "local", "count": 22, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "hp": 1500, "attack": 150, "base_hp": 1500, "base_attack": 150, "damage_type": "physical", "attack_speed": 40, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 101, "move_speed": 800.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.2999999523162842, "assassin_resist": 2000, "transform_resist": 2000, "pattern_id": 2097648, "race_id": 9, "master_id": 36, "global_id": 35, "spawn_sec": 6}, {"enemy_id": 5, "source": "local", "count": 17, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "hp": 6000, "attack": 1000, "base_hp": 6000, "base_attack": 1000, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 100, "attack_speed": 120, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 241, "move_speed": 400.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.7000000476837158, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2100144, "race_id": 10, "master_id": 219, "global_id": 218, "spawn_sec": 35}], "dialogue": [{"trigger": "start", "lines": [{"name": "バシラ", "text": "こんなに早く次が攻めて来るなんて。\nこれじゃ休む暇もありませんよ～……。", "face": "u28"}, {"name": "ギガース", "text": "――さぁ同胞達よ！　\n我らギガース族の雪辱、\n今こそ果たそうぞ！！", "face": "l418a3a8ea7af"}, {"name": "モーティマ", "text": "連中、随分と気合が入ってやがんな。", "face": "u14"}, {"name": "ケイティ", "text": "あの数の巨人……それだけ\n本気と言う事でしょう。ここが正念場です。", "face": "u114"}, {"name": "エレーヌ", "text": "……皆ありがとう。\n私達の国の事なのに、協力してくれて。", "face": "u481"}, {"name": "アンナ", "text": "お気になさらないでください。\n困ったときはお互い様ですよ！"}, {"name": "アンナ", "text": "王子、決して気が抜けない戦いです。\n全力で迎え撃ちましょう！", "face": "l4680010083c3"}]}, {"trigger": "end", "lines": [{"name": "ギガース", "text": "――ぐ、ぐわあああぁぁぁああぁぁッ！", "face": "l418a3a8ea7af"}, {"name": "アンナ", "text": "やった！　やりましたよ！\nギガース達を倒しましたよ、エレーヌさん！"}, {"name": "エレーヌ", "text": "……流石にあの量、私達だけじゃ危なかった。\n皆がいてくれて助かった……これで街も――", "face": "u481"}, {"name": "ギガース", "text": "――ぐぅっ……く、くくくっ！\nくははははっ！\nぐふっ！　げふぉぁっ！！", "face": "l418a3a8ea7af"}, {"name": "ケイティ", "text": "……っ！　何が可笑しい！！", "face": "u114"}, {"name": "ギガース", "text": "……く、くくく……我らは所詮……陽動……。\n今頃本隊が……壁の最も弱い所を……\n………………。", "face": "l418a3a8ea7af"}, {"name": "エレーヌ", "text": "…………壁の弱い所……\nまさか……ここと真逆の……っ！", "face": "u481"}, {"name": "アンナ", "text": "……エレーヌさん、すみませんが\n案内をお願いできますでしょうか。\n王子、急いで向かいましょう！", "face": "l4680010083c3"}]}], "map": {"image": "Map920090_3974", "w": 960, "h": 640, "spots